idx":1,"text":"Timo, du glaubst nicht, wen ich heute im Supermarkt getroffen habe!","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Wen denn?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Meike!","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Wir hatten uns seit der Schule nicht mehr gesehen, bevor wir uns heute erkannt haben.","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Unglaublich!","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Hattest du sie überhaupt wiedererkannt?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":7,"text":"Erst nicht, aber nachdem sie gelacht hatte, war es sofort klar.","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L005","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, du glaubst nicht, wen ich heute im Supermarkt getroffen habe!","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Wen denn?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Meike! Wir hatten uns seit der Schule nicht mehr gesehen, bevor wir uns heute erkannt haben.","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Unglaublich! Hattest du sie überhaupt wiedererkannt?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L004","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":5,"text":"Erst nicht, aber nachdem sie gelacht hatte, war es sofort klar.","speaker":"Wenke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_020_L005","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Wir hatten uns seit der Schule nicht gesehen, bevor wir uns heute erkannten.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Erzähl, wen du im Supermarkt getroffen hast.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Nachdem wir uns aus den Augen verloren hatten, gab es nur noch Streit.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, wie es zu dem Konflikt kam.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Nachdem ich mich beworben hatte, bekam ich den Studienplatz.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Deine Kollegin fragt, wie du den Studienplatz bekommen hast.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Als ich zurückkam, hatte sich alles verändert.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Erzähl, was du festgestellt hast, als du zurückkamst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Nachdem ich die Bildung abgeschlossen hatte, wurde ich sofort berufstätig.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, warum du berufstätig wurdest.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":6,"text":"Ich hatte zu viel verloren, deshalb blieb ich beim Alten.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1"},{"chapter":"b1-20-plusquamperfekt","level":"B1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":6,"text":"Deine Freundin fragt, warum du beim Alten geblieben bist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":7,"text":"Bevor wir uns trafen, hatt